PROJECT: After Hours Podcast — Podcast Landing & Guest Application Site
TECH STACK:
- React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
- Bolt Cloud PostgreSQL database (Supabase under the hood, managed by Bolt)
- React Router DOM for routing (/, /apply, /privacy, /admin)
- n8n webhook for submission notifications
- AWS Lambda for admin authentication

DESIGN RULES (NEVER DEVIATE):
- Dark theme ONLY. Background: #0A0A0A. No light mode.
- Text: #FFFFFF for headings, #E5E5E5 for body, #999999 for muted/placeholder text
- Display font: "Bebas Neue" (Google Fonts) — ALL section headings, always uppercase, massive sizes (4xl–7xl responsive)
- Body font: Inter (or system sans-serif fallback)
- Accent: Gold gradient via class "text-gradient-gold" — background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A84C, #E8D48B) with -webkit-background-clip: text
- Every H2 follows the pattern: white text + LAST WORD wrapped in <span className="text-gradient-gold">
- Section separators: border-t with subtle gold glow (border-gold-glow class)
- CTA buttons: gold gradient background (#C9A84C → #E8D48B), black text, rounded-xl, all caps, tracking-wider, font-bold (btn-gold class)
- Secondary buttons: outline style with gold border, white text (btn-outline-gold class)
- Cards: bg-[#0D0D0F], border-gold-glow, rounded-2xl, hover effects (hover-lift + shadow)
- Inputs: background #141414, border #2A2A2A, focus glow with subtle white/silver
- Rounded corners: 12px on cards/inputs/buttons
- No nav bar on the landing page
- Max content width: 1200px (max-w-6xl) for landing sections, 640px for questionnaire
- All CEO Media logos should have rounded edges (rounded-2xl on large, rounded-lg on small)

PURPOSE:
After Hours is Fresh's (Walter Weekes) podcast. The site replicates the digitalsocialhour.com structure to promote the podcast, attract sponsored guests, and collect guest applications. The podcast features entrepreneurs, creators, and thought leaders. Fresh is the host, and Brett manages the business side.

ANIMATIONS & VISUAL POLISH:
- Scroll-triggered reveal animations on all sections (useScrollReveal hook in src/hooks/useScrollReveal.ts)
- CSS classes: .reveal, .reveal.visible, .reveal-delay-1 through .reveal-delay-6
- Hero entrance: animate-float on logo, animate-fadeInUp on text, animate-fadeIn on stats
- Animated stat counters: AnimatedNumber component counts from 0 to target value
- Enhanced hover: btn-gold scales 1.03 + gold glow, .hover-lift adds -4px translateY, .guest-hover removes grayscale on portraits
- FAQ accordion with openFaq state and .faq-answer CSS transitions

HOMEPAGE STRUCTURE (LandingPage.tsx):
1. HERO — full-bleed background image with dark overlay + gradient fade, floating logo (animate-float), subtitle, 3 animated stats row
2. BE A GUEST — flex row (Fresh image in stadium shape left, text right), H2 + body text + Apply CTA → navigates to /apply
3. TOP EPISODES — centered H2 + subtitle, 3-column video card grid (9 cards) with staggered reveal + hover-lift
4. SPONSOR THE SHOW — same flex layout as Be a Guest (logo left, text right), H2 + 2 buttons
5. AWARD — centered social proof image
6. FOOTER — logo + nav links, platform buttons (YouTube/Spotify/Apple Podcasts), copyright

APPLY PAGE STRUCTURE (ApplyPage.tsx at /apply):
1. TOP NAV — logo left, "← Home" link right
2. HERO — massive headline with gold gradient key words, subtitle, scarcity line, two CTA buttons
3. STATS BAR — 4 animated stat counters (border-y separator)
4. RANKINGS — 4 cards in 2x2 grid showing platform rankings
5. PAST GUESTS — circular grayscale portraits in 6-col grid (guest-hover for color on hover)
6. WHY SPONSOR — 6 benefit cards in 2-col grid with icons (hover-lift)
7. MID-PAGE CTA — centered Apply button
8. MASTERMIND COMMUNITY — chat icon + heading + 2 community description cards
9. SPONSORSHIP PACKAGES — 2 pricing tiers (Standard $12,500 / Premium $15,000) with feature lists
10. GUEST TESTIMONIALS — 6 placeholder video cards with play buttons
11. FAQ ACCORDION — 13 Q&A items with chevron toggle
12. FINAL CTA — "YOUR SEAT IS WAITING" + Apply Now button
13. FOOTER — logo, social links, legal links, disclaimer, copyright

ROUTING:
- / → App.tsx (homepage with FULL_LANDING flag → LandingPage or SimpleLandingHero)
- /apply → ApplyPage.tsx (sales/application page)
- /privacy → PrivacyPolicy.tsx
- /admin → AdminLayout.tsx (dashboard)
- /?apply=true → auto-starts questionnaire via App.tsx useEffect

SECTION LAYOUT PATTERNS:
- Stadium/oblong image shape: rounded-full on non-square element (w-full h-auto) creates natural elongated rounded shape
- "Mascot sections" (Be a Guest, Sponsor): flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto
- Video cards: rounded-2xl, border-gold-glow, aspect-video image + text div, hover: scale 105% + play button
- Stats: font-display text-gradient-gold for numbers, muted uppercase tracking-wider for labels
- Staggered reveals: style={{ transitionDelay: `${i * 0.05}s` }} on mapped elements

CODING STANDARDS:
- TypeScript strict mode, functional components, React hooks
- Tailwind utility classes, custom CSS only in index.css
- All form validation client-side before database submission
- Data arrays (EPISODES, STATS, PAST_GUESTS, BENEFITS, PACKAGES, FAQS, etc.) as const arrays at top of file, rendered via .map()

MOBILE (PRIORITY):
- Mobile-first responsive design
- All touch targets minimum 44px
- Video grid: 1 col mobile, 2 col sm, 3 col lg
- Past guests: 3 col mobile, 6 col md+
- Mascot sections: stack vertically on mobile, side-by-side on md+
- Stadium image shape: use max-h-44 sm:max-h-48 md:max-h-56 to keep proportions consistent

EXISTING FUNCTIONALITY (DO NOT BREAK):
